      "writtenOn": "2018-01-08T22:40:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I guess you mean \"Because we load records even for locked\"?\nI think the logic is that \"Loaded means all apps are loaded, while Locked means any app is locked\".  Once we saw any app is locked, the states of the other apps do not matter because we will boradcast \"locked\" anyway, right?  So we don\u0027t need to do similar (or same) check here. As for the point that \"we load records even for locked\", it is actually not related to this line of code since the SIMRecords will load the ICCID anyway and this line only send out the internal broadcast to SubscriptionInfoUpdater.",
      "parentUuid": "0bdcbf44_d9c83579",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 241,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 241,
        "endChar": 34
      },
      "revId": "cf8ea63f894f83253c769b167975ba472b6f7ba4",
