      "writtenOn": "2018-01-08T22:40:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the method \"areAllApplicationsReady()\" will only be called when at least one \"APP Ready\" is received so that in normal cases this would never happen.  I added this check just in case something weird happens, like after receiving one app ready and suddenly switching to a profile with no apps. in that situation, I prefer to let the user believe the Apps are not ready... What do you think?",
